  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>模組包介紹：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">你在《Minecraft》中模擬西部荒野所需的一切，正如我的YouTube頻道（<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yaboysneak\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@yaboysneak</a>）上所展示的！如果有任何問題，歡迎聯絡我，我會盡力回覆。歡迎隨意修改，盡情享受！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>特色功能：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">西部荒野主題模組包，包含全新盔甲與武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">新增生成結構與世界生成</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">更多西部荒野主題的生物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">全新的西部荒野維度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">火車！</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>在伺服器上遊玩（點擊橫幅！）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/SNEAK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/cbfc0ef9-e5d2-4095-891f-8c898b76f012.webp\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;前往我的頻道看看：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mQlH-TzbYZA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
